1
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:06,000
Fall in love with the grumpiest man in America.

2
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:06,000
A Man Called Otto is a comedy, drama film directed by Marc Forster.

3
00:21:00,000 --> 00:21:06,000
When a lively young family moves in next door, grumpy widower Otto Anderson meets his match in a quick-witted,
pregnant woman named Marisol, leading to an unlikely friendship that turns his world upside down.

4
00:28:00,000 --> 00:28:06,000
Otto Anderson, played by Tom Hanks.

