Tommy, played by Manuel Garcia-Rulfo.

9
01:03:00,000 --> 01:03:06,000
Anita, played by Juanita Jennings.

10
01:10:00,000 --> 01:10:06,000
A Man Called Otto is a 2022 American comedy-drama film directed
by Marc Forster from a screenplay by David Magee.

11
01:17:00,000 --> 01:17:06,000
It is a remake of the 2015 Swedish film A Man Called Ove, which was based
on the 2012 novel of the same name by Fredrik Backman.

12
01:24:00,000 --> 01:24:06,000
The film stars Tom Hanks and his son Truman in the title role, with Mariana
Treviño, Rachel Keller, and Manuel Garcia-Rulfo in supporting roles.

13
01:31:00,000 --> 01:31:06,000
The plot follows a bitter old man who reluctantly gets
involved in the lives of his neighbors.

14
01:38:00,000 --> 01:38:06,000
A Man Called Otto began a limited theatrical release on December 29, 2022, before a wide
release in the United States on January 13, 2023, by Sony Pictures Releasing.

15
01:45:00,000 --> 01:45:06,000
The film received positive reviews from critics and grossed $113
million worldwide against a $50 million production budget.

16
01:52:00,000 --> 01:52:06,000
The film explores themes of friendship, based on novel or
book, suicide attempt, melancholy, flashback.

17
01:59:00,000 --> 01:59:06,000
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
